lemented, offering a simplified view by default, removing unnecessary technical details.\n\n\nAnalyzing how to integrate the existing code visualizer seamlessly into the new DSA section. The goal is a consistent user experience; the visualizer must be easily accessible from both the learning section and the problem workspace. The design will preserve current animation and functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"C:/Users/CVT/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/code-flow-visualizer/app_build/dsa_dashboard.js\"","EndLine":"560","StartLine":"530","toolAction":"\"Viewing loadSettings in dsa_dashboard.js\"","toolSummary":"\"View loadSettings\""}}]}
